{{define "title"}}Your Chronos account has been erased{{end}}
{{define "content"}}
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;">Hello{{if .Name}} {{.Name}}{{end}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;">Your Chronos account has been <strong>erased</strong>, as you
  asked.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;">The key that made your personal data readable has been destroyed.
  Your name, your email address and everything else we held about you can no longer be read by
  anyone — including us. This is not a deletion flag: there is no copy to restore from, and no
  way to undo it.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;">This is the last message you will receive from us at this
  address.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;"><strong>What is retained, and why:</strong></p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 20px;padding-left:20px;">
{{range .Retained}}  <li style="margin:0 0 6px;">{{.}}</li>
{{end}}</ul>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;">If you believe this was done without your permission, contact
  support — though please note we can no longer look you up by name or address.</p>
{{end}}
